        "publication_date": "2024-06-25",
        "description": "<p>Data and code for the paper:</p>\n<p>Ruba Al Khalaf, Anna Bernasconi, and Pietro Pinoli. 2024.</p>\n<p>\"Systematic analysis of SARS-CoV-2 Omicron subvariants' impact on B and T cell epitopes\"</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>This repository contains:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The datasets curated: a <strong>Epitopes datasets.zip </strong>folder contains two files a T cell epitopes file and a B cell epitopes file, and a <strong>Subvariants dataset.zip</strong> folder contains a file of the characterizing mutations list of each subvariants used in the analysis.</li>\n<li>The code:&nbsp;<strong>The notebook</strong> file contains the Jupyter Notebook (Python code) of the analysis.</li>\n<li>The supplementary file of the paper: a <strong>Supplementary Materials.zip </strong>file contains all the supplementary figures and files mentioned in the paper.</li>\n<li>A&nbsp;<strong>Figures.zip</strong> folder contains all the generated figures -used in the paper- in high resolution.</li>\n</ul>",
